  "scope": "At each fixed level the finite set of true native basis indices with eigenvalue < 1/4 counts multiplicities. Positivity of the original cuspidal eigenvalue makes each exceptional order alpha strictly below 1/2. The coefficient Fourier transform can be evaluated at each of these finitely many complex frequencies before passing through the finite sum; no order gap uniform in the level follows."
